B-D1-2: strip or pin the unpkg script for a future CLI render, as the live path does at make-book-pdf.ts:60, and keep --no-sandbox out of code.
B-D1-3: plan.md:72 cites the first-run capture with no repo path, and the capture lives only at /tmp/d1-heavy-tests.txt. Copy it into measure/runs before the 2026-12-15 re-check.

